{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And fire came forth.</b> R. Eliezer says: the sons of Aharon died only because they ruled a halakhah in the presence of Moshe their master. R. Yishmael says: they entered the Sanctuary drunk with wine. Know this — that after their death He warned the survivors not to enter the Sanctuary drunk with wine. A parable: to a king who had a household attendant, etc. — as found in Vayikra Rabbah."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:36.445323425Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}